<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, May 06 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper up 1000, tin down 35, lead unchanged, zinc down 225, aluminium down 2625, nickel up 18, aluminium alloy down 240</p>
